Spider dataset
  This repository does not contain the Spider dataset. It contains example ids (data/question_ids.json)
  and a few quoted questions and gold queries (some shortened) in README.md as failure examples.
  Spider: Yu et al., "Spider: A Large-Scale Human-Labeled Dataset for Complex and Cross-Domain
  Semantic Parsing and Text-to-SQL Task", EMNLP 2018. https://yale-lily.github.io/spider
  Spider is licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
  The quoted Spider excerpts in this repository, and the split files that scripts/get_spider.sh
  builds from Spider, remain under CC BY-SA 4.0. The code in this repository is MIT.

Traigent SDK
  This code depends on the Traigent SDK (traigent on PyPI), which is licensed AGPL-3.0 or under a
  commercial license. The SDK is installed from PyPI and not included here.

Other dependencies (LiteLLM, Google Cloud client libraries, PyYAML) keep their own licenses.
